  \-pkcs12 signer.p12 \(rs
  \-readpass p12\-pass.txt \(rs
  \-add\-msi\-dse \(rs
  \-in installer.msi \(rs
  \-out installer\-signed.msi
.EE
.SS Use a PKCS#11 provider
.IP
.EX
osslsigncode sign \(rs
  \-provider /path/to/pkcs11prov.so \(rs
  \-pkcs11module /path/to/opensc\-pkcs11.so \(rs
  \-pkcs11cert \(aqpkcs11:token=my\-token;object=cert\(aq \(rs
  \-key \(aqpkcs11:token=my\-token;object=key\(aq \(rs
  \-readpass pin.txt \(rs
  \-in app.exe \(rs
  \-out app\-signed.exe
.EE
.SS Add a timestamp to an already signed file
.IP
.EX
osslsigncode add \(rs
  \-ts \(dqhttps://tsa.example.net/\(dq \(rs
  \-in app\-signed.exe \(rs
  \-out app\-signed\-ts.exe
.EE
.SS Verify that a file is covered by a catalog
.IP
.EX
osslsigncode verify \(rs
  \-catalog drivers.cat \(rs
  \-CAfile ca\-bundle.pem \(rs
  \-CRLfile ca\-crl.pem \(rs
  \-in driver.sys
.EE
